Package: nbzinbKoo
Title: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression by IRLS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Grace", "Koo", , "koogc@miamioh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively
    reweighted least squares alternated with Newton-Raphson for the
    dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial regression
    by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are IRLS fits, without calling a
    general-purpose optimizer. Standard errors for the zero-inflated model
    come from the analytic observed information matrix.
